2026-08-20T02:21:12.7444314Z [36;1m[0m
2026-08-20T02:21:12.7444638Z [36;1m# Do NOT export UserNM here, however tempting the `UserNM=true` trick[0m
2026-08-20T02:21:12.7445095Z [36;1m# from AGENTS.md looks. It is a development shortcut, not a CI setting.[0m
2026-08-20T02:21:12.7445437Z [36;1m#[0m
2026-08-20T02:21:12.7445636Z [36;1m# R takes the nm program from $UserNM in[0m
2026-08-20T02:21:12.7446005Z [36;1m# tools:::read_symbols_from_object_file, and that function serves two[0m
2026-08-20T02:21:12.7446441Z [36;1m# callers, not one: building `symbols.rds` at install time (which[0m
2026-08-20T02:21:12.7446815Z [36;1m# src/Makevars puts on the `all:` target), *and*[0m
2026-08-20T02:21:12.7447201Z [36;1m# tools:::check_so_symbols scanning the built .so during `R CMD check`.[0m
2026-08-20T02:21:12.7447656Z [36;1m# Pointing nm at `true` blinds the second one, so the check finds no[0m
2026-08-20T02:21:12.7448105Z [36;1m# symbols at all and reports "Found no calls to 'R_registerRoutines',[0m
